     A*****************************************************************
     A* FILE NAME:  ORDDTL                                            *
     A* RELATED PGMS:  ORDENT                                         *
     A* RELATED FILES:  ORDMST  (ORDER HEADER, KEYED BY ORDID)        *
     A*                 INVMST  (ITEMID MUST EXIST THERE)             *
     A* DESCRIPTION:  ORDER LINES. KEYED BY ORDID + LINE. PRICE IS THE *
     A*          UNIT PRICE AS ENTERED ON THE ORDER, KEPT PER LINE.    *
     A*****************************************************************
     A          R ORDDREC
     A            ORDID          7  0       TEXT('ORDER ID')
     A            LINE           3  0       TEXT('LINE NUMBER')
     A            ITEMID        10          TEXT('INVENTORY ITEM ID')
     A            QTYORD         7  0       TEXT('QUANTITY ORDERED')
     A            QTYSHP         7  0       TEXT('QUANTITY SHIPPED')
     A            PRICE          9  2       TEXT('UNIT PRICE')
     A          K ORDID
     A          K LINE
